      "writtenOn": "2019-12-18T05:46:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "question: It seems we don\u0027t need to do any low/high layer clean up in the function.\nIIUC this is correct today because:\n  1. we use new default to replace old default.\n  2. routing will be clean up when disconnecting default network\n  3. network doesn\u0027t lose its CAP_INTERNET after connected.\nIs it possible that we only have 1 network but we don\u0027t want that to be the default anymore?",
      "range": {
