        "id": 1306837
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-12-18T06:17:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "After discuss with Lucas, he pointed out losing NET_CAPABILITY_TRUSTED might be the case.\nIf so, we clean up internally but keeps the routing.\nApps can still using untrusted network as default network.\nIs that a problem?",
      "parentUuid": "9518ad42_dec08dcb",
      "range": {
