      "writtenOn": "2019-12-18T07:45:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Well, I think I found another interesting thing that the newNetwork will never be null in this function if my below analysis is true.\n\nSince line.6507 try to get the new network by ObjectUtils#getOrElse(), and if the first parameter is null, then ObjectUtils#getOrElse() will return second parameter.\n\nSo, the case1, let\u0027s pretend the first parameter is not null, and the ObjectUtils#getOrElse() will return first parameter as new default network.\nIt means the newNetwork in this function is not null, that\u0027s fine.\n\nThe problem is in case2, let\u0027s pretend the first parameter is null, and the ObjectUtils#getOrElse() will return the second parameter as new default network.\nAnd the line.6510 will check if the \"oldDefaultNetwork !\u003d newDefaultNetwork\", since we just assigned oldDefaultNetwork to newDefaultNetwork, so this condition will be false because oldDefaultNetwork is equal to newDefaultNetwork, and the makeDefault() will not be called.\n\nBased on above 2 cases, there is no chance to pass the null value into makeDefault().\nSo the mDefaultNetworkNai has no chance to be reset to null until the connection is really disconnected(namely, disconnectAndDestroyNetwork() is be called).\n\nAlthough it\u0027s a corner case which will only happen when there is only one default network and the default network lose its NET_CAPABILITY_TRUSTED(for example).\nBut if the mDefaultNetworkNai will not be reset to null which will make a bug and make all the functions which will call the getDefaultNetwork() going wrong.\n\nSo maybe we should abandon this commit?\nAny thoughts?",
      "parentUuid": "c185d85e_91b85829",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 6255,
        "startChar": 17,
        "endLine": 6255,
        "endChar": 28
      },
      "revId": "e91f661f78ead74dfd29601ae9b388cf880bbd3d",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "8c4d7c6c_9ed59914",
        "filename": "services/core/java/com/android/server/ConnectivityService.java",
        "patchSetId": 10
      },
      "lineNbr": 6255,
