      "side": 1,
      "message": "Called clearDefaultNetId when null.\nAnother option would be to call\n\n  setDefaultNetId(newNetwork !\u003d null ? newNetwork.network.netId : UNSET_NETID);\n\n...since setDefaultNetId(UNSET_NETID) reads to me as it clears the default.\nKept clearDefaultNetId for now as it is the dedicated netd method, so I think we should use this, but if someone feels strongly that we should use set(UNSET_NETID) instead I\u0027m happy to change it.\n\n\nAs for the name, I think makeDefault(null) makes sense and should just make it so that there is no default network. If you feel strongly it should be named something else I don\u0027t mind renaming it.",
